msgstr "Jeśli to nie Ty, zignoruj tę wiadomość: nic nie zostało zmienione."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Someone, hopefully you, asked to create an account at %(app)s with this "
"email address. An account with this address already exists, so no new one"
