"CoinGecko id, EODHD ticker, GoldAPI metal (XAU/XAG/XPT/XPD), or XAU for "
"NBP gold."
msgstr ""
"Identyfikator CoinGecko, ticker EODHD, metal GoldAPI (XAU/XAG/XPT/XPD) "
"lub XAU dla złota NBP."

